{
  "name": "Nightly XML Sitemap Crawler to Keep AI Vector Knowledgebase 100% Fresh",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚡ Nightly XML Sitemap Crawler to Keep AI Vector Knowledgebase 100% Fresh\n\n**What this workflow does:**\nAutomatically crawl any site’s sitemap.xml every night and sync updated pages into your customer support RAG vector database.\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [`laborious_rumor/sitemap-xml-llm-knowledgebase-crawler`](https://apify.com/laborious_rumor/sitemap-xml-llm-knowledgebase-crawler) (*First 1,000 results 100% Free — zero login cookies required!*)\n\n### Setup in 30 Seconds:\n1. Get your free Apify API token at [console.apify.com/settings/integrations](https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations).\n2. Open the **Run Apify XML Sitemap Crawler & Knowledgebase Builder** HTTP Request node and replace `YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN` with your token.\n3. Click **Test Workflow** to extract, deduplicate, and score live structured JSON records!",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 640
      },
      "id": "d709ee0d-2f8b-4020-acdd-6eb827901a96",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Setup Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🔎 Stage 1: Schedule, Target Queries & Apify Extraction\nTriggers daily, sets your target search queries and `maxItems`, and runs the cookie-free **XML Sitemap Crawler & Knowledgebase Builder** Actor synchronously via the Apify REST API.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 740
      },
      "id": "ce3b72db-b25a-4c25-a5cf-af7b003c23f5",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Stage 1 Extraction",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🧹 Stage 2: Quality Filtering, Deduplication, Lead Scoring & Export\nFilters verified records, deduplicates by URL/ID, normalizes and scores each record with JavaScript, summarizes the batch, and routes high-priority items downstream.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 980
      },
      "id": "9db6cfcb-7eeb-4fa1-a128-eee7d3816b6a",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Stage 2 Processing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        950,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 24
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "ca87f6d3-52b0-48a5-ac58-ad046fe130c5",
      "name": "Daily Schedule Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        200,
        460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "4f5199c2-c029-43e9-a364-e6d31d327c5c",
              "name": "queries",
              "value": "[\"https://docs.n8n.io/sitemap.xml\",\"https://docs.apify.com/sitemap.xml\"]",
              "type": "array"
            },
            {
              "id": "68d8fbb4-d7c0-4a38-aec9-3e177f042093",
              "name": "maxItems",
              "value": 25,
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "daa5c1f6-ab9f-4c83-af5f-083f50ac41b6",
              "name": "pipelineCategory",
              "value": "AI, RAG & Tech",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "58272bb5-89f1-446d-a179-5db50f3168a4",
      "name": "Configure Target Queries",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        440,
        460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/laborious_rumor~sitemap-xml-llm-knowledgebase-crawler/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "token",
              "value": "YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ queries: $json.queries, maxItems: $json.maxItems }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        }
      },
      "id": "c7953732-8d18-47b6-aa11-941d91b2602b",
      "name": "Run Apify XML Sitemap Crawler & Knowledgebase Builder",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        700,
        460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": false,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "34781c3f-37c1-4ec8-a421-bb530d558f6d",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.verifiedStatus ?? true }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "d9e0e024-1659-4410-a695-409672b07242",
      "name": "Filter Verified Records",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        980,
        460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "compare": "selectedFields",
        "fieldsToCompare": "url, title, recordId",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "da99f977-d5f6-4a6b-a350-ba6ea1b4348d",
      "name": "Deduplicate Extracted Items",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.removeDuplicates",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1220,
        460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "language": "javaScript",
        "jsCode": "const items = $input.all();\nreturn items.map((item, index) => {\n  const d = item.json || {};\n  const hasEmail = Boolean(d.email || d.workEmailPattern || (Array.isArray(d.emails) && d.emails.length > 0));\n  const hasUrl = Boolean(d.url || d.website || d.sourceUrl);\n  const qualityScore = (hasEmail ? 50 : 20) + (hasUrl ? 30 : 10) + (d.verifiedStatus ? 20 : 10);\n  return {\n    json: {\n      ...d,\n      normalizedTitle: d.title || d.fullName || d.businessName || d.name || 'Extracted Record #' + (index + 1),\n      primaryUrl: d.url || d.website || d.sourceUrl || '',\n      primaryContact: d.email || d.workEmailPattern || (Array.isArray(d.emails) ? d.emails[0] : '') || d.phone || '',\n      leadQualityScore: qualityScore,\n      priorityTier: qualityScore >= 80 ? 'HIGH_PRIORITY' : 'STANDARD',\n      actorSource: 'sitemap-xml-llm-knowledgebase-crawler',\n      processedAt: new Date().toISOString()\n    }\n  };\n});"
      },
      "id": "d35bd9f8-fc22-4647-a1a3-8975439a1b42",
      "name": "Normalize and Score Records",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1460,
        460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": false,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "35f1f8c8-8f85-4742-a2d4-487e87b683e3",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.leadQualityScore }}",
              "rightValue": 60,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "gte"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "af72f3fe-7ca8-458b-a098-ce98eafde20e",
      "name": "Route High-Quality Records",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1700,
        460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "ec1e7c1e-51bb-4f25-a2ed-097168830399",
              "name": "title",
              "value": "={{ $json.normalizedTitle }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c29f9ffc-f712-424d-a811-6fe9c72e92ab",
              "name": "url",
              "value": "={{ $json.primaryUrl }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "20915459-b89e-4438-a77d-2f386ee9b74a",
              "name": "contact",
              "value": "={{ $json.primaryContact }}",
